From 15b9ca43c199fc0ec8de9e401b5bfc9b742edcb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guru Pratap Sharma <guruprat@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Dec 2025 02:06:57 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] UPSTREAM:PROTOCOL: hostapd: Retain orignal bandwidth for all
 AFC requests

Currently, the Access Point (AP) does not retain the original bandwidth
after receiving the next AFC response when the bandwidth changes.
This causes inconsistencies because the AP starts processing subsequent
requests without considering the initial bandwidth configuration,
leading to incorrect calculations and potential performance issues.

To fix this update the bandwidth handling logic for the second and
subsequent AFC requests. At the start of processing each new request,
restore the original bandwidth before running the AFC algorithm.
This ensures that the algorithm operates on the correct baseline
bandwidth and maintains consistency across all AFC responses.

Fixes: I47b8c3d32832 (UPSTREAM:PROTOCOL: hostapd: Fix AFC random channel selection)

Patch-work: None
Tag: 6G_REGULATORY
Feature: AFC
Patch-dependency:
n00-001-hostapd-add-support-for-6GHz-operation.patch,
r65-QSDK-HOSTAPD-Implement-Min-PSD-Calculation-and-Punct.patch,
r66-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Fetch-AFC-support-from-wiphy.patch,
r66-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Handle-AFC-Channel-Change.patch,
r72-a-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-6-GHz-power-mode-channels-.patch,
r72-b-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Print-6-GHz-power-mode-cha.patch,
r72-c-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Store-6-GHz-power-mode-cha.patch,
r72-d-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Clean-up-and-refactor-6-GH.patch,
r72-e-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Support-for-SP-and-Punctur.patch,
r72-f-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Add-6-GHz-regulatory-struc.patch,
r72-g-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Add-6-GHz-base-regulatory-.patch,
r72-h-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Apply-best-power-mode-for-.patch,
r72-i-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Fix-6-GHz-power-mode-confi.patch,
r72-j-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Handle-empty-AFC-power-eve.patch,
r73-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Select-Random-Channel-Change.patch,
r74-UPSTREAM-PROTOCOL-hostapd-Call-random-channel-change.patch,
